--[[
    LIMUI — Fluid Glass Universal UI Library
    ========================================

    A universal, game-agnostic Roblox UI framework built for executor-loaded
    scripts. Fluid Glass aesthetics, centralized Motion Engine, Theme Engine
    with Theme Studio, Window Manager, sidebar navigation, search/command
    palette, notifications, widgets dashboard, minimize modes, persistence.

    Public syntax:

        local UI = loadstring(game:HttpGet("URL"))()
        local W = UI:Window({ Title = "Hub" })
        local T = W:Tab("Principal")
        T:Button("Executar", function() print("ok") end)

    Advanced table form:

        T:Button({ Title = "Executar", Description = "...", Callback = function() end })

    No game-specific logic is hardcoded. The host script owns tabs, actions
    and data. LimUI owns rendering, interaction, appearance and animation.

    Version: 3.0.0
--]]

